WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.300
Hi, I'm Matt,

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.400
a Lead Product Designer
based in West Yorkshire.

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:07.700
My experience spans B2B software
and global e-commerce,

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.400
designing for both
complex business workflows

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.200
and everyday shopping needs.

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:14.850
I take a user-centred approach,

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:17.750
combining both accessible design
with hands-on development

00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:19.950
to turn complex problems into clear,

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:21.300
working products.

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:24.400
I also enjoy mentoring other designers,

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:26.580
helping them find the confidence
that they need

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:28.200
to take the lead on their own projects.

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:30.150
Have a look around,

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:31.800
and if you think we'd work well together,

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:33.050
I'd love to hear from you.

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:34.050
Thank you!
